OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe odd light shower in the
OL,6,Fmorning, but otherwise most parts will
OL,7,Fhave a dry day with some bright or
OL,8,Fsunny spells. Light winds but breezier
OL,9,Fon the north coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry and bright evening with
OL,12,Fsome late hazy sunny spells. Remaining
OL,13,Fdry overnight with clear spells at
OL,14,Ftimes, although cloud will increase
OL,15,Flater in the night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA dry and bright start. Cloud
OL,18,Fwill steadily thicken through the day,
OL,19,Fbringing a few outbreaks of light,
OL,20,Fpatchy rain during the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
